654	Since 17~October 2026 it opens a type \KWD{where}-clause variable in the same
655	way, as in the clause of \TYP{AnyList} in \library\ (row~636): an argument whose
656	type is such a trait, passed where the listed type is expected, takes the listed
657	type at a type of the value's own for that call, bounded as the variable's
658	binding bounds it and known to equal only itself; it does not bound that type
